# Sites with intermittent availability for automated checkers
https://hepdata.net/
https://transport.ec.europa.eu/
https://www.copernicus.eu/

# Star badge links: /stargazers returns 404 to anonymous clients, so every
# entry failed on every run and hid the real broken links. The repository URL
# itself is still checked.
https://github.com/.*/stargazers

# Moved here from the --exclude flags of the old links job in main.yml, so
# both link checks skip the same hosts.
img\.shields\.io
iso20022\.org
ted\.europa\.eu
